From fb9d2d984655d9ab958d4ff7a2856e3603bd2791 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Quintin Smits <qd.smits@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 15:46:30 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] feat(post): check every native Agie punch and threading
 corridor

Qualify separate modeled punches on one stock. Check each pair of complete wire envelopes and use independent controller work and geometry names.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #2980
